{%- comment -%}
  Naomi Katz Art: "Buy by bank transfer" button.
  Paste this into the product page template, directly under the Add to cart button.
  It only shows while the product is purchasable (status "active"). When an artwork is
  reserved by someone else, the portal hides the product on the store, so the whole page
  (and this button) disappears until the reservation ends.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% if product.status == 'active' %}
  <a class="bank-transfer-button"
     href="https://pay.naomikatzart.com/reserve/{{ product.id }}"
     style="display:block;margin-top:12px;padding:14px 18px;text-align:center;
            border:1px solid #b3123f;border-radius:8px;color:#b3123f;
            font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">
    Buy by bank transfer and save A$300
  </a>
{% endif %}
